{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"3月3日！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな祭りですね☺︎☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/03/5149139/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/03/5149139/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな祭りということで\n女のコっぽい服装を..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生写真のバレンタインの撮影だよ！\nピンク色のモコモコのアンゴラニットが\nお気に入り( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/03/5149139/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピンク色のリボンチョーカーも\nとてつもなく可愛い！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛すぎて普段は付けられないけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段着られないような格好を\n出来るのが嬉しいです☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとひな祭りということで\nおばあちゃんがちらし寿司を\n作ってくれたよ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/03/5149139/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"具沢山でとっても美味しかったヽ(；；)丿\nいっぱい食べちゃったヽ(；；)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年はおばあちゃんちにある\n７段飾りが出せなかったので\n来年こそは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立派な７段飾り皆さんにもお見せしたい◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「THANX」WANIMAさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業シーズンのこの時期に\nぴったりの曲ではないかなと。\nそして雲の上にお友達がいる方にも。\nWANIMAさんの声やテンポから\n全力さやがむしゃらさが伝わってきて、\n歌詞からは優しさと切なさが伝わってくる。\n素敵すぎます。\n\"さよならが教えてくれた\n離れるのは距離だけと\"\n例え距離が離れても\nこころは近くにある。\n好きだな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は久しぶりに握手会ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんにお会いできるの\n楽しみにしてました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なに着ようかな〜\nどんな髪型にしようかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部後の生誕祭も楽しみです☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}